rising EV penetration, and increased export targets. Talbros Automotive Components Limited reported its financial and operational performance for Q1 FY27, highlighting revenue growth, order wins across business segments including exports and EVs, and strategic joint ventures.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company targets group revenue growth of about 18% to 20% for FY27.","quote":"For FY27, we continue to continue to have a target group revenue target of about 18% to 20%, with margins being in the range of about 17-odd percent, a little bit maybe 17.5% because we're still working out the whole impact of the inflationary pressures.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"The company is targeting to increase its exports contribution to 35% by FY28.","quote":"We are targeting to take our exports to 35% by FY28.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Management remains confident of delivering a 15% to 20% year-on-year growth in FY27.","quote":"We remain confident of delivering a 15% to 20% year-on-year growth in '27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=885ff0ef-a9f6-4ccb-bfbc-3077a94d93fa.pdf"},{"claim":"The company aims to maintain EBITDA margins between 17% to 18% through product mix, operational leverage, and cost management.","quote":"Our focus will be to maintain EBITDA margins between 17% to 18% through product mix and operational leverage as well as cost management.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=885ff0ef-a9f6-4ccb-bfbc-3077a94d93fa.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"The passenger vehicle industry recorded sales of approximately 1.27 million units, registering a growth of 26% year-on-year.","quote":"The passenger vehicle industry recorded sales of approximately 1.27 million units, registering a growth of 26% year-on-year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"The 2-wheeler segment grew by almost 20% year-on-year at 5.63 million units.","quote":"The 2-wheeler segment also continues recovery with a growth of almost 20% year-on-year at 5.63 million units.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Commercial vehicles recorded an industry volume of nearly 2.83 lakh units, registering a 15% growth.","quote":"Commercial vehicles recorded steady performance during quarter with industry volume of nearly 2.83 lakh units, registering a healthy 15% growth.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Electric vehicle passenger vehicles volume grew by 87% year-on-year.","quote":"EV passenger vehicles volume grew by 87% year-on-year, while electric 2-wheeler continued to gain market share.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Electric 2-wheeler continued to gain market share with a growth of approximately 68%.","quote":"EV passenger vehicles volume grew by 87% year-on-year, while electric 2-wheeler continued to gain market share. with a growth of approximately 68%, supported by increasing charging infrastructure.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Global OEMs are accelerating supply-chain realignments toward reliable alternate geographies as they reduce dependence on China.","quote":"Global OEMs reducing China dependence are accelerating supply-chain realignments toward reliable alternate geographies","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8321d73f-d41d-4f1a-9d6b-977ee312da1f.pdf"},{"claim":"Demand is still looking good in quarter 1 as management speaks.","quote":"The demand is still looking good in quarter 1 as I speak.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=885ff0ef-a9f6-4ccb-bfbc-3077a94d93fa.pdf"},{"claim":"Inquiries remain strong despite West Asia war potential cost pressures.","quote":"While the West Asia war may lead to some temporary cost pressures, inquiries remain strong, and we believe Talbros is well placed to navigate these challenges.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=885ff0ef-a9f6-4ccb-bfbc-3077a94d93fa.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The planned capex for the year is about INR103 crores across gaskets, forgings, and heat shields.","quote":"Our planned capex is about INR103 crores for the year across gaskets, forgings, heat shields and to try and meet the demands of the OEM.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Marelli Talbros Chassis Systems capex for FY27 is planned at INR 39 crs.","quote":"Marelli Talbros Chassis Systems* (MTCS) 19 - 39","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8321d73f-d41d-4f1a-9d6b-977ee312da1f.pdf"},{"claim":"Talbros Marugo Rubber capex for FY27 is planned at INR 12 crs.","quote":"Talbros Marugo Rubber** (TMR) | 5 12","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8321d73f-d41d-4f1a-9d6b-977ee312da1f.pdf"},{"claim":"Gujarat facility capex for the chassis JV is shifted to FY27 and FY28.","quote":"Now with the order we have received on Maruti and Tata Motors. So accordingly, the SOP will start on later date, so we will — the capex of Gujarat will be now be shifted to 27, '28.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=885ff0ef-a9f6-4ccb-bfbc-3077a94d93fa.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Margins during the quarter witnessed temporary pressure on account of elevated commodity prices, particularly steel and aluminium as well as labour increases.","quote":"Margins during the quarter witnessed temporary pressure on account of elevated commodity prices, particularly steel and aluminium as well as other inflation costs such as labour increases in some states.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"EBITDA for Q1 FY27 stood at INR43 crores with a margin of 17.6%.","quote":"For Q1 of FY27, our EBITDA stood at INR43 crores with a margin of 17.6% PAT for the quarter stood at INR30 crores, growing 35% year-on-year basis.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Gasket division EBITDA increased to INR29 crores with a growth of 32% year-on-year.","quote":"EBITDA increased to INR29 crores with a growth of 32%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Forging division EBITDA stood at INR14 crores in Q1 of FY27 as against INR13 crores of Q1 of FY26.","quote":"EBITDA stood at INR14 crores in QI of FY27 as against INR13 crores of Q1 of FY26.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Sustainable EBITDA margin can be assumed around 17%.","quote":"Around 17%, you can assume.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d942a7da-bc57-40ea-9cce-8fa406f5c400.pdf"},{"claim":"Q4 FY26 EBITDA grew 12.9% with a record high margin of 18.7%.","quote":"At the EBITDA level, at Q4, we declared EBITDA of INR45 crores, a growth of 12.9% and a record high margin of 18.7%, reflecting robust operating leverage and disciplined cost ‘management.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=885ff0ef-a9f6-4ccb-bfbc-3077a94d93fa.pdf"},{"claim":"FY26 EBITDA margin remained healthy at 17.5%.","quote":"EBITDA for FY26 stood at INR155 crores as against INR147 crores in FY25. EBITDA margin remained healthy at 17.5%, reflecting the benefits of operational improvement, cost management initiatives and a better product mix.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=885ff0ef-a9f6-4ccb-bfbc-3077a94d93fa.pdf"},{"claim":"Geopolitical tensions in West Asia led to an increase in raw material and freight costs.","quote":"Geopolitical tensions in the West Asia region led to an increase in raw material and freight costs.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=885ff0ef-a9f6-4ccb-bfbc-3077a94d93fa.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"The gasket and heat shield division gave a 52% share in the revenue.","quote":"Our gasket and heat shield division continue to remain the largest contributor to our business, giving a 52% share in t